<title>BELGIUM: BASIC FACTS - SWISS INCA BANK SA - CERA.</title>
<headline>BASIC FACTS - SWISS INCA BANK SA - CERA.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are basic facts</p>
<p>released by Belgian Cera Bank about Inca Bank SA, the Swiss bank</p>
<p>specialising in private banking, which Cera Bank is buying.</p>
<p>    Balance sheet total:	11 million Swiss francs</p>
<p>    Shareholders' equity:	7 million  &quot;     &quot;</p>
<p>    Assets under management: 125 million  &quot;     &quot;</p>
<p>    Staff:			  15</p>
<p>    Ownership:    Gaetan Carnaut (80 pct)</p>
<p>			Unnamed German, U.S. investor (20 pct)</p>
<p>NOTE - source: Cera Bank. A spokesman declined to say</p>
<p>whether Inca Bank was profitable.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
